'''Nightblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Shadow Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

== Appearance ==
It is a black reflective sword with a serpentine blade, meaning that its blade is wavy in shape. The guard is made up of two curved quillons in the shape of wings, and the handle is sleek and slim with a sharp pointed pommel attached to the bottom of it. 

==Trivia ==
* The [[Shadow Item Pack]] was available in the [[shop]] for over two years, making Nightblade the longest purchasable godly weapon from a [[Gamepasses|gamepass]].
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/103359953/Shadow-Sword Shadow Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 999 Robux.
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Skelly]].
* When salvaged, it provides 3 godly [[shards]].

